 "_doc_merged": "Merged set for game GLBs at 3-6 draw calls. Each SH_* swatch above is baked as a COLOR_0 vertex colour (its 'base') and the mesh is merged into the merged material named in swatch_to_merged. Merged materials are plain glTF metallic/roughness (three.js MeshStandardMaterial). There are no KHR_materials_* extensions and no textures (KTX2 only, if one is ever needed; never PNG/JPG). Emissive strength is 1.0, so KHR_materials_emissive_strength is not needed.",
 "merged_materials": {
  "SHM_Paint": {
   "base": "#ffffff",
   "metal": 0.0,
   "rough": 0.42,
   "vertex_colors": true
  },
